{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mutagenic virus has spread across world, transforming the infected into deadly zombies and mutant creatures. Humanity\u2019s last hope lies in small outposts equipped with purifiers \u2014 devices that release cleansing fumes to neutralize the airborne virus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a squad of survivors in this minimalist top-down action RTS. Defend each base from waves of enemies. Every level is a fight to keep the purifiers running \u2014 and stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305010/extras/806ccc219d85a56e23808b1fa1f17577.poster.avif?t=1773415271\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305010/extras/806ccc219d85a56e23808b1fa1f17577.webm?t=1773415271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305010/extras/806ccc219d85a56e23808b1fa1f17577.mp4?t=1773415271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level features a different layout and challenge. Purifiers attract enemies \u2014 you must protect them to survive and win.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Skill Tree</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a wide range of upgrades that shape your tactics and offer new ways to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305010/extras/3190b0b58fed2c34f5de158f72c17066.poster.avif?t=1773415271\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305010/extras/3190b0b58fed2c34f5de158f72c17066.webm?t=1773415271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305010/extras/3190b0b58fed2c34f5de158f72c17066.mp4?t=1773415271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; Items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons and tools are limited. Use them smartly to overcome each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305010/extras/054d6b379a692cb7e619aa35624eb4c1.poster.avif?t=1773415271\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305010/extras/054d6b379a692cb7e619aa35624eb4c1.webm?t=1773415271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305010/extras/054d6b379a692cb7e619aa35624eb4c1.mp4?t=1773415271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3305010?t=1773415271","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3305010?t=1773415271","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305010/19a0014c28d69ab84f0523b1983995ee3cb08a85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773415271","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305010/19a0014c28d69ab84f0523b1983995ee3cb08a85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773415271","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4509080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mu